algorithms.pseudocode:
Algorithm: CertifyRobustness(network, domain, L)
1. regions ← EnumerateActivationRegions(network, domain)
2. nerve ← BuildNerve(regions)  // O(|regions|^2)
3. for each vertex v_i in nerve:
     M(v_i) ← inf{margin(x) : x ∈ K ∩ R_i}
4. δ ← min_i M(v_i)
5. if δ > 0:
     return δ / L  // certified radius
   else:
     return FAIL(vulnerable regions where M ≤ 0)
